WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:06.341
A whole crate of lemons, and Maya can carry only two at a time!

3
00:00:06.865 --> 00:00:10.131
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.654 --> 00:00:13.178
This is Episode 75.

5
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:15.565
Meet the bucket-chain.

6
00:00:16.089 --> 00:00:20.558
One rope, many buckets, from the ground all the way up to the cloud.

7
00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:24.207
Scoop, lift, tip, back down.

8
00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:27.691
Again and again, fast and steady.

9
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:30.196
One bucket is chipped?

10
00:00:30.719 --> 00:00:32.217
Swap it.

11
00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.852
The chain never stops.

12
00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:38.772
Up top, every lemon lands in its cubby box.

13
00:00:39.296 --> 00:00:42.704
Same lemons, same order, nothing lost.

14
00:00:43.228 --> 00:00:45.799
That is AWS DataSync.

15
00:00:46.322 --> 00:00:51.015
It moves big piles of files to the cloud, fast, and checks every one.

16
00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:53.591
Now you know the bucket-chain!

17
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

